 "source_instruction": "i'm looking for coaxial cable for video accessories it can intall at any",
 "query": "I spent the whole morning out on my back porch trying to rescue the little sparrow that got stuck in the hanging fern I hung up last weekend, y\u2019know? The poor thing had wedged itself between the wicker basket and the root ball of the fern, fluttering so hard it knocked a handful of dried fronds all over the porch rail before I could gently work my hand in to guide it out. It sat on my porch rail for a full two minutes after I freed it, tilting its little striped head at me like it was saying thanks before it flitted off to join the other birds chirping in the maple tree at the edge of the yard. I even left a small dish of sunflower seeds out on the rail for it after it left, just in case it needed a quick snack after all that stress.\nHey there, I\u2019m browsing the satellite television section looking for a coaxial cable, right? I need something with a really good price point, nothing that\u2019s going to break the bank for a small home setup, y\u2019know? Oh, and make sure it comes bundled with a pack of reusable cable zip ties, that\u2019d be super helpful for tucking wires behind my TV stand. Wait, can you show me the options that match that? I don\u2019t really have super specific preferences on the signal specs or outer finish as long as it works for hooking up my satellite box.",
